{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50688","headline":"江南杂题三十首 其十七 · 张祜","name":"江南杂题三十首 其十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小槛云低处，高廊雨过时。\n鹿胎含笋箨，猿臂长松枝。\n旧匣藏鈎轸，沉查骨钓丝。\n（「骨」，严云：疑当作「罥」。\n）平生心未远，徒欲效鸱夷。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}